PG  - 436-43
LID - 10.1183/09031936.00038809 [doi]
AB  - The aim of this report is to describe the highlights of the European Respiratory 
      Society annual congress in Berlin, Germany. The best abstracts in asthma and 
      allergy, cystic fibrosis, respiratory infection, paediatric and neonatal 
      intensive care, paediatric investigative techniques (in particular respiratory 
      physiology and bronchoscopy) and respiratory epidemiology are presented and set 
      in the context of the current literature.
