AB  - Flexible and rigid bronchoscopy are the thoracic surgeon's stethoscope. These 
      tools are vital to evaluating, diagnosing, and treating a tracheobronchial 
      pathologic condition. Airway dilation, used appropriately and selectively, is an 
      effective method of treating various tracheal pathologic conditions.
