TI  - Management of the difficult pediatric airway with Shikani Optical Stylet.
PG  - 342-5
AB  - The airways of children with many craniofacial and mandibulofacial malformations 
      often present unique challenges to the anesthesiologists. We report the 
      application of Shikani Optical Stylet (SOS) in facilitating the tracheal 
      intubation of four children with history of difficult airway management. The SOS 
      combines the benefits of the lightwand and fiberoptic bronchoscope.
