TI  - Innovations in technology for critical care medicine.
PG  - 74-6
AB  - This new section in Critical Care presents a selection of clinically important 
      examples of advances in critical care health technology. This article is divided 
      into two main areas: diagnostics and monitoring. Attention is given to how 
      bedside echocardiography can alter the cardiovascular physical examination, and 
      to novel imaging techniques such as virtual bronchoscopy. The monitoring section 
      discusses recent claims of improved efficiency with telemedicine for intensive 
      care units.
