TI  - [Detection of early stage bronchopulmonary cancer: contribution of bronchoscopy].
PG  - 453-7
AB  - Efficient methods for lung cancer screening is today an important challenge in 
      research. Into this article, we review the available techniques for the detection 
      of hilar located lung cancers, mainly squamous cell carcinoma. Fluorescence 
      bronchoscopy is the latest major advance for lung cancer diagnosis.
