TI  - [Virtual bronchoscopy].
PG  - 261-8
AB  - Flexible bronchoscopy represents a clinically well-established invasive 
      diagnostic tool. Virtual bronchoscopies, calculated from thin-slice CT sections, 
      allow astonishing immitations of reality although principal differences exist 
      between both technologies: the fact that colour representation is artificial and 
      concommitant interventions are impossible limits the clinical use of virtual 
      bronchoscopy. However, its value increases when calculations can be attained 
      within minutes due to technological advancements, and when virtually any chest CT 
      is suitable for further postprocessing. Indications, findings and the clinical 
      role of virtual bronchoscopy are discussed.
