TI  - PreOp endoscopy simulator: from bronchoscopy to ureteroscopy.
PG  - 344-9
AB  - The high cost of virtual reality simulators has posed a major obstacle to the 
      widespread adoption of simulators for medical training. HT Medical broke through 
      this cost barrier by developing the PreOp Flexible Bronchoscopy simulator, a 
      realistic training simulation system that integrates force feedback, multimedia, 
      and 3D graphics on a PC. We are currently extending the PreOp platform so that it 
      can simulate other endoscopic procedures. This paper discusses our efforts to 
      extend the platform to simulate flexible sigmoidoscopy and ureteroscopy.
