TI  - An uncommon mimic of an acute asthma exacerbation.
PG  - 1707-9
AB  - Foreign body aspiration in adults has a variety of clinical presentations and 
      often goes unrecognized. We describe the case of a patient who experienced crack 
      cocaine aspiration and presented with symptoms of an acute asthma exacerbation 
      requiring mechanical ventilation until the eventual diagnosis and bronchoscopic 
      removal of the foreign body.
