TI  - [Selection of bronchoscope type for removal of foreign bodies from the lower 
      respiratory tract based on personal experience].
PG  - 623-8
AB  - 32 patients, in whom bronchoscopy was performed due to the removal of foreign 
      body from the lower respiratory tract were described. Age of the patients 
      clinical symptoms and a time lapse between aspiration and removal of foreign body 
      from the lover respiratory tract and localization of foreign body in the 
      particular bronchus were analysed. We conclude, that rigid bronchoscopy is still 
      more useful and safe method of foreign body removing from the lower respiratory 
      tract.
