TI  - [Exfoliative cytological diagnosis of lung cancer with bronchoscopic material].
PG  - 15-7
AB  - Analysis of the results of exfoliative cytological diagnosis of lung diseases 
      from fibrobronchoscopic materials in the presence of the affected bronchial 
      mucosa made it possible to verify lung cancer in 75.9% of cases and to give a 
      descriptive reply due to the fact that cytological specimens were of no 
      diagnostic value. Further examinations of transthoracic puncture specimens and 
      clinical and X-ray findings of patients from the latter group could reveal an 
      inflammatory process in two thirds of cases and peripheral lung cancer in a 
      third.
