AB  - Bronchoscopy in a 4.5-year-old girl with recurrent pneumonia showed an exophytic 
      endobronchial mass. Biopsy disclosed microscopic and ultrastructural features of 
      a low-grade mucoepidermoid carcinoma. Complete cure was accomplished by surgical 
      removal of the tumor and right lower lobe.
