TI  - Bedside procedures. Solutions to the pitfalls of intrahospital transport.
PG  - 1-6, v
AB  - The technology to perform diagnostic and therapeutic procedures at the bedside 
      continues to advance. Because of documented hazards and the expense of 
      intrahospital transport, the bedside is becoming an appealing site for procedures 
      that are more commonly performed in radiologic, bronchoscopic, other procedural 
      suites, and the operating room.
